[en.FOCUS_C01_NEW_HOLIDAYS]
New Holiday Movement

[en.FOCUS_C01_NEW_HOLIDAYS_desc]
Traditional holidays such as Hearth’s Warming are no longer proper for the new era. New holidays such as Jahr Null and Coronation Day should be celebrated instead.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_NEW_HOLIDAYS]
新节日运动

[zh.FOCUS_C01_NEW_HOLIDAYS_desc]
诸如暖炉节等传统节日已经不再适合，新的时代应该庆祝新元年、登基日等新的节日。

